      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DA SOUZA (3) was quickly into stride and burnt early from out wide where he gave a sight, finishing second (25.76) and beaten 0.8 lengths over 460m at Geelong. Yet to taste defeat from three runs out of this box. Must come into calculations. INDY MARTY (8) was out of the placings last time when seventh at The Meadows (31.18) but did record best time of the card when winning three back. Worth following up. SAY MY GRACE (1) turned in a plain effort last time when fifth at this track over 515m behind Ayden's Warrior (30.34) in a Mix 3/4. Was a winner the start prior. Strong form has emerged from his last run. Should be thereabouts. SWIFT GIFT (2) boasts a solid strike-rate over this trip.",
